# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# me-tric — repository-level ignore rules
#
# The nested manifests (client/.gitignore, client/src-tauri/.gitignore,
# client/src-tauri/gen/apple/.gitignore) already cover the paths they own.
# This file only adds defences that must hold at the repository root, so a
# stray build or runtime artefact can never be committed from any directory.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Rust build output -----------------------------------------------------
# `cargo build` writes ~7 GB into client/src-tauri/target. There is exactly one
# workspace (client/src-tauri), but the vendor patch and transport crate are
# built beneath it, so match the directory at any depth to stay safe.
target/
**/target/

# --- Frontend assembly output ----------------------------------------------
# Produced by `bun run build-frontend.js`. Regenerated on every build, never
# hand-edited, and tautologically derived from frontend/ + client/.
frontend-dist/
**/frontend-dist/

# --- Node ------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
bun.lockb

# --- Runtime state ---------------------------------------------------------
# The desktop app persists devices, preferences and plaintext remembered
# passwords in me-tric.sqlite3. That must never enter version control.
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-journal
*.sqlite3-wal
*.sqlite3-shm
*.db

# Checked-in test fixtures usually need to be visible, so the common example
# database is exempted explicitly rather than by weakening the rule above.
!**/fixtures/**/*.db

# --- Local configuration / secrets ----------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx

# --- Editor / IDE ----------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json
.idea/
*.iml
*.swp
*~

# --- OS --------------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# --- Tauri / platform generated -------------------------------------------
# These are regenerated by `tauri build`; the handwritten parts live in
# src-tauri/ and gen/apple/ tracked files.
client/src-tauri/gen/schemas/
*.app
*.dmg
*.msi
*.msix
*.AppImage
*.deb
*.rpm
*.snap

# --- Logs ------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
logs/
